The statistical methodology implemented here follows published references
(Montgomery; AIAG; NIST/SEMATECH; ASTM; Bissell 1990), cited per formula in
docs/FORMULAS.md. Those references are not distributed with this software.

examples/pistonrings.csv and examples/pistonrings_phase1.csv contain piston-
ring diameter measurements taken from the R package 'qcc' (dataset
'pistonrings'); the measurements originate from Montgomery, Introduction to
Statistical Quality Control. They are included as reference data for
verifying the implementation against published values, not as part of the
licensed software.
